VALUES ('doc-11-oasis-taxii21-p65-11', 'doc-11-oasis-taxii21', '', 65, '2. It SHOULD use an HTTP User-Agent string to correctly identify the software name and version as defined in section 5.5.3 of [RFC7231].', 'kb-doc-11-oasis-taxii21-p65-11', 0, 23, '11-oasis-taxii21', 'retrieved', '1D46EF0992E251562EBEB09D614D43EA0425FB4805107D6565573F8FE30BBF50', 'v1', '{"source_id": "11-oasis-taxii21", "version": "retrieved", "corpus_version": "v1", "knowledge_object_type": "REFERENCE_CONCEPT"}')
