VALUES ('doc-11-oasis-taxii21-p66-2', 'doc-11-oasis-taxii21', '', 66, '8.5.2 Server Certificate Verification ● The default strategy for TAXII Clients authenticating and verifying the server''s TLS certificate SHOULD be PKIX as defined in [RFC5280], [RFC6818], [RFC6125] et al.', 'kb-doc-11-oasis-taxii21-p66-2', 0, 29, '11-oasis-taxii21', 'retrieved', '0A47EBE9196184AD90EDB0A4931E23BFA752CBAA5C67AD8464A3973F882D0594', 'v1', '{"source_id": "11-oasis-taxii21", "version": "retrieved", "corpus_version": "v1", "knowledge_object_type": "REFERENCE_CONCEPT"}')
