VALUES ('doc-13-nist-genai-profile-p26-6', 'doc-13-nist-genai-profile', '', 26, 'MAP 1.1: Intended purposes, potentially beneﬁcial uses, context speciﬁc laws, norms and expectations, and prospective settings in which the AI system will be deployed are understood and documented. Considerations include: the speciﬁc set or types of users along with their expectations; potential positive and negative impacts of system uses to individuals, communities, organizations, society, and the planet; assumptions and related limitations about AI system purposes, uses, and risks across the development or product AI lifecycle; and related TEVV and system metrics.', 'kb-doc-13-nist-genai-profile-p26-6', 0, 81, '13-nist-genai-profile', 'retrieved', '6FDE2D7505D555B4A9FBBE99E6EFAFCD3755B7D81E087DF2B80C0E8D320FD16A', 'v1', '{"source_id": "13-nist-genai-profile", "version": "retrieved", "corpus_version": "v1", "knowledge_object_type": "REFERENCE_CONCEPT"}')
